{"unit_id":"YaoleWu__review-workflow#card-zh","repo":"YaoleWu/review-workflow","commit":"f423c032ce55694916d5e1edf6520722b1cd809b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"review-workflow 是一个面向 DSH 的通用结构化评审 skill，通过 skills 服务在运行时注册。它把评审组织为材料检查、准备 bundle、多名评委独立评分、汇总分歧、Critic 复核和形成最终决定六步，并在步骤间设置 checkpoint。流程还定义锚定一致性与分歧等级处理、复评时聚焦修改项，以及由项目提供 rubric、模板和 checklist。适合需要可追溯、多角色评审流程的项目、论文、代码或设计审查；需要项目级评审配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["host.js:5-14","host.js:21-25"]}
{"unit_id":"YaoleWu__review-workflow#card-en","repo":"YaoleWu/review-workflow","commit":"f423c032ce55694916d5e1edf6520722b1cd809b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"review-workflow is a DSH skill for structured reviews. It guides material checks, independent scoring, disagreement resolution, Critic review, and final decisions through checkpoints. Projects supply rubrics and templates. For traceable project, paper, code, or design reviews.","source":"generated","evidence":["host.js:5-14","host.js:21-25"]}
