{"unit_id":"YaoleWu__review-workflow#feature-six-stage","repo":"YaoleWu/review-workflow","commit":"f423c032ce55694916d5e1edf6520722b1cd809b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"review-workflow 的功能「六步评审流程」：从材料完整性检查开始，经过 bundle 准备、独立评分、分歧聚合和 Critic 复核，最后形成决定。各阶段由流程说明衔接。","source":"generated","evidence":["host.js:21-25","host.js:70-74"]}
{"unit_id":"YaoleWu__review-workflow#feature-checkpoints","repo":"YaoleWu/review-workflow","commit":"f423c032ce55694916d5e1edf6520722b1cd809b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"review-workflow 的功能「流程检查点」：每一步都定义 checkpoint，并规定未满足条件时暂停、退回或请求补充，帮助评审按阶段推进。","source":"generated","evidence":["host.js:21-25","host.js:70-74"]}
{"unit_id":"YaoleWu__review-workflow#feature-disagreement","repo":"YaoleWu/review-workflow","commit":"f423c032ce55694916d5e1edf6520722b1cd809b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"review-workflow 的功能「分歧裁决」：先比较评委的锚定对照，再按评分差异 Δ 处理；差异较大时要求补充理由并重评或升级人工裁决。","source":"generated","evidence":["host.js:21-25","host.js:70-74"]}
{"unit_id":"YaoleWu__review-workflow#feature-rereview","repo":"YaoleWu/review-workflow","commit":"f423c032ce55694916d5e1edf6520722b1cd809b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"review-workflow 的功能「聚焦复评」：复评时检查材料的新版本，只重跑与修改项相关的维度，其余维度沿用原评分，并在最终决定中记录新轮次。","source":"generated","evidence":["host.js:21-25","host.js:70-74"]}
